{"title":"蓝桥杯真题：最小砝码（贪心与数学推导)","slug":"2024-04-08-最小砝码","date":"2024-04-08T00:18:23.000Z","updated":"2026-05-14T05:56:56.076Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/2024-04-08-最小砝码.json","excerpt":null,"covers":null,"content":"<h2 id=\"问题描述\"><a href=\"#问题描述\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"问题描述\"></a>问题描述</h2><p>你有一架天平。现在你要设计一套砝码，使得利用这些砝码可以称出任意小于等于 $N$ 的正整数重量。那么这套砝码最少需要包含多少个砝码？注意砝码可以放在天平两边。</p>\n<h2 id=\"输入格式\"><a href=\"#输入格式\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"输入格式\"></a>输入格式</h2><p>输入包含一个正整数 $N$。</p>\n<h2 id=\"输出格式\"><a href=\"#输出格式\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"输出格式\"></a>输出格式</h2><p>输出一个整数代表答案。</p>\n<h2 id=\"题目分析与推导\"><a href=\"#题目分析与推导\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"题目分析与推导\"></a>题目分析与推导</h2><p>这是一道经典的数学推导与贪心算法结合的题目。我们需要找到能覆盖 $[1, N]$ 范围内所有整数重量的最少砝码组合。</p>\n<h3 id=\"1-贪心策略的选择\"><a href=\"#1-贪心策略的选择\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"1. 贪心策略的选择\"></a>1. 贪心策略的选择</h3><p>砝码可以放在天平的两端，这意味着对于每一个砝码，它有三种状态：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>放在左盘（记为 $+w$）。</li>\n<li>放在右盘（记为 $-w$）。</li>\n<li>不放（记为 $0$）。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>这实际上对应了<strong>平衡三进制</strong>（Balanced Ternary）的概念。</p>\n<h3 id=\"2-为什么选择-1-3-9-dots-？\"><a href=\"#2-为什么选择-1-3-9-dots-？\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"2. 为什么选择 $1, 3, 9, \\dots$？\"></a>2. 为什么选择 $1, 3, 9, \\dots$？</h3><p>假设我们已经有一组砝码，能称出的最大重量为 $M$。当我们加入一个新的砝码 $w$ 时，由于砝码可以放在两边，我们能称出的新范围会发生变化。</p>\n<p>设当前砝码能称出的最大重量为 $K$（即能覆盖 $[1, K]$ 的所有整数）。<br>当我们加入一个新砝码 $w$ 时，新的可称量范围变为：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>原有范围：$[1, K]$</li>\n<li>新增范围（利用新砝码 $w$）：<ul>\n<li>$w$ 单独：$w$</li>\n<li>$w + [1, K]$：$[w+1, w+K]$</li>\n<li>$w - [1, K]$（放在异侧）：$[w-K, w-1]$</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>为了使砝码利用率最高且覆盖范围连续（即不出现断层），我们需要满足：</p>\n<script type=\"math/tex; mode=display\">w - K = K + 1</script><p>这样新的称量范围就能无缝衔接，从 $w-K$ 一直覆盖到 $w+K$。</p>\n<p>解方程得：</p>\n<script type=\"math/tex; mode=display\">w = 2K + 1</script><p>此时，新的最大称量范围更新为 $w + K = 3K + 1$。</p>\n<h3 id=\"3-推导过程\"><a href=\"#3-推导过程\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"3. 推导过程\"></a>3. 推导过程</h3><p>根据上述推导，我们来确定砝码序列：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>第一个砝码</strong>：初始 $K=0$，则 $w_1 = 2(0) + 1 = 1$。<ul>\n<li>当前最大称重 $K_{new} = 1$。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>第二个砝码</strong>：当前 $K=1$，则 $w_2 = 2(1) + 1 = 3$。<ul>\n<li>当前最大称重 $K_{new} = 1 + 3 = 4$（覆盖 $1$ 到 $4$）。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>第三个砝码</strong>：当前 $K=4$，则 $w_3 = 2(4) + 1 = 9$。<ul>\n<li>当前最大称重 $K_{new} = 4 + 9 = 13$（覆盖 $1$ 到 $13$）。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>第四个砝码</strong>：当前 $K=13$，则 $w_4 = 2(13) + 1 = 27$。<ul>\n<li>当前最大称重 $K_{new} = 13 + 27 = 40$。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>结论</strong>：最优的砝码组合是 $3$ 的幂次方（$1, 3, 9, 27, \\dots$）。<br>题目转化为：找到最小的整数 $n$，使得前 $n$ 个 $3$ 的幂次方之和大于等于 $N$。</p>\n<p>递推公式为：</p>\n<script type=\"math/tex; mode=display\">S_n = S_{n-1} \\times 3 + 1</script><p>当 $S_n \\ge N$ 时，$n$ 即为答案。</p>\n<h2 id=\"代码实现\"><a href=\"#代码实现\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"代码实现\"></a>代码实现</h2><h3 id=\"Python-代码\"><a href=\"#Python-代码\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"Python 代码\"></a>Python 代码</h3><figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br><span class=\"line\">23</span><br><span class=\"line\">24</span><br><span class=\"line\">25</span><br><span class=\"line\">26</span><br><span class=\"line\">27</span><br><span class=\"line\">28</span><br><span class=\"line\">29</span><br><span class=\"line\">30</span><br><span class=\"line\">31</span><br><span class=\"line\">32</span><br><span class=\"line\">33</span><br><span class=\"line\">34</span><br><span class=\"line\">35</span><br><span class=\"line\">36</span><br><span class=\"line\">37</span><br><span class=\"line\">38</span><br><span class=\"line\">39</span><br><span class=\"line\">40</span><br><span class=\"line\">41</span><br><span class=\"line\">42</span><br><span class=\"line\">43</span><br><span class=\"line\">44</span><br><span class=\"line\">45</span><br><span class=\"line\">46</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">solve</span>():</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 初始化当前能称出的最大重量为 0</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    current_max = <span class=\"number\">0</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 初始化砝码数量为 0</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    count = <span class=\"number\">0</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    </span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">try</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        N = <span class=\"built_in\">int</span>(<span class=\"built_in\">input</span>())</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">except</span> EOFError:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">return</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 循环直到能称出的最大重量大于等于 N</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">while</span> current_max &lt; N:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        count += <span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"comment\"># 根据公式：新砝码 = 当前最大 * 2 + 1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"comment\"># 实际上，新的最大称重 = 当前最大 * 3 + 1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"comment\"># 推导：new_max = current_max + (2*current_max + 1) = 3*current_max + 1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        current_max = current_max * <span class=\"number\">3</span> + <span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        </span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(count)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">if</span> __name__ == <span class=\"string\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">    solve()</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">### 代码解析</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">1.</span>  **变量初始化**：`current_max` 代表当前砝码组合能连续称出的最大重量。初始为 <span class=\"number\">0</span>，代表还没有砝码。</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">2.</span>  **循环条件**：`<span class=\"keyword\">while</span> current_max &lt; N`，只要当前能称出的重量还达不到目标 $N$，就需要继续加砝码。</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">3.</span>  **状态转移**：每次循环，砝码数量 `count` 加 <span class=\"number\">1</span>。根据数学推导，加入新砝码后，能称出的最大重量变为原来的 <span class=\"number\">3</span> 倍加 <span class=\"number\">1</span>（即 `current_max = current_max * <span class=\"number\">3</span> + <span class=\"number\">1</span>`）。</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">4.</span>  **输出结果**：当循环结束时，`count` 即为最少需要的砝码数。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">## 复杂度分析</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">-   **时间复杂度**：$O(\\log_3 N)$。因为 `current_max` 每次以 <span class=\"number\">3</span> 倍增长，增长速度非常快，循环次数极少。</span><br><span class=\"line\">-   **空间复杂度**：$O(<span class=\"number\">1</span>)$。只使用了几个变量存储状态，不需要额外的数组空间。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">## 示例验证</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">假设输入 $N = <span class=\"number\">20</span>$：</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">1.</span>  初始 `current_max = <span class=\"number\">0</span>`, `count = <span class=\"number\">0</span>`。</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">2.</span>  第一轮：`count = <span class=\"number\">1</span>`, `current_max = <span class=\"number\">0</span>*<span class=\"number\">3</span>+<span class=\"number\">1</span> = <span class=\"number\">1</span>` (&lt; <span class=\"number\">20</span>)。</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">3.</span>  第二轮：`count = <span class=\"number\">2</span>`, `current_max = <span class=\"number\">1</span>*<span class=\"number\">3</span>+<span class=\"number\">1</span> = <span class=\"number\">4</span>` (&lt; <span class=\"number\">20</span>)。</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">4.</span>  第三轮：`count = <span class=\"number\">3</span>`, `current_max = <span class=\"number\">4</span>*<span class=\"number\">3</span>+<span class=\"number\">1</span> = <span class=\"number\">13</span>` (&lt; <span class=\"number\">20</span>)。</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">5.</span>  第四轮：`count = <span class=\"number\">4</span>`, `current_max = <span class=\"number\">13</span>*<span class=\"number\">3</span>+<span class=\"number\">1</span> = <span class=\"number\">40</span>` (&gt;= <span class=\"number\">20</span>)。</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">6.</span>  结束循环，输出 `<span class=\"number\">4</span>`。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">砝码组合为：$<span class=\"number\">1</span>, <span class=\"number\">3</span>, <span class=\"number\">9</span>, <span class=\"number\">27</span>$。可以验证，这 <span class=\"number\">4</span> 个砝码能称出 $<span class=\"number\">1</span>$ 到 $<span class=\"number\">40</span>$ 的所有整数重量。</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>","more":"<h2 id=\"问题描述\"><a href=\"#问题描述\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"问题描述\"></a>问题描述</h2><p>你有一架天平。现在你要设计一套砝码，使得利用这些砝码可以称出任意小于等于 $N$ 的正整数重量。那么这套砝码最少需要包含多少个砝码？注意砝码可以放在天平两边。</p>\n<h2 id=\"输入格式\"><a href=\"#输入格式\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"输入格式\"></a>输入格式</h2><p>输入包含一个正整数 $N$。</p>\n<h2 id=\"输出格式\"><a href=\"#输出格式\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"输出格式\"></a>输出格式</h2><p>输出一个整数代表答案。</p>\n<h2 id=\"题目分析与推导\"><a href=\"#题目分析与推导\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"题目分析与推导\"></a>题目分析与推导</h2><p>这是一道经典的数学推导与贪心算法结合的题目。我们需要找到能覆盖 $[1, N]$ 范围内所有整数重量的最少砝码组合。</p>\n<h3 id=\"1-贪心策略的选择\"><a href=\"#1-贪心策略的选择\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"1. 贪心策略的选择\"></a>1. 贪心策略的选择</h3><p>砝码可以放在天平的两端，这意味着对于每一个砝码，它有三种状态：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>放在左盘（记为 $+w$）。</li>\n<li>放在右盘（记为 $-w$）。</li>\n<li>不放（记为 $0$）。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>这实际上对应了<strong>平衡三进制</strong>（Balanced Ternary）的概念。</p>\n<h3 id=\"2-为什么选择-1-3-9-dots-？\"><a href=\"#2-为什么选择-1-3-9-dots-？\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"2. 为什么选择 $1, 3, 9, \\dots$？\"></a>2. 为什么选择 $1, 3, 9, \\dots$？</h3><p>假设我们已经有一组砝码，能称出的最大重量为 $M$。当我们加入一个新的砝码 $w$ 时，由于砝码可以放在两边，我们能称出的新范围会发生变化。</p>\n<p>设当前砝码能称出的最大重量为 $K$（即能覆盖 $[1, K]$ 的所有整数）。<br>当我们加入一个新砝码 $w$ 时，新的可称量范围变为：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>原有范围：$[1, K]$</li>\n<li>新增范围（利用新砝码 $w$）：<ul>\n<li>$w$ 单独：$w$</li>\n<li>$w + [1, K]$：$[w+1, w+K]$</li>\n<li>$w - [1, K]$（放在异侧）：$[w-K, w-1]$</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>为了使砝码利用率最高且覆盖范围连续（即不出现断层），我们需要满足：</p>\n<script type=\"math/tex; mode=display\">w - K = K + 1</script><p>这样新的称量范围就能无缝衔接，从 $w-K$ 一直覆盖到 $w+K$。</p>\n<p>解方程得：</p>\n<script type=\"math/tex; mode=display\">w = 2K + 1</script><p>此时，新的最大称量范围更新为 $w + K = 3K + 1$。</p>\n<h3 id=\"3-推导过程\"><a href=\"#3-推导过程\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"3. 推导过程\"></a>3. 推导过程</h3><p>根据上述推导，我们来确定砝码序列：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>第一个砝码</strong>：初始 $K=0$，则 $w_1 = 2(0) + 1 = 1$。<ul>\n<li>当前最大称重 $K_{new} = 1$。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>第二个砝码</strong>：当前 $K=1$，则 $w_2 = 2(1) + 1 = 3$。<ul>\n<li>当前最大称重 $K_{new} = 1 + 3 = 4$（覆盖 $1$ 到 $4$）。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>第三个砝码</strong>：当前 $K=4$，则 $w_3 = 2(4) + 1 = 9$。<ul>\n<li>当前最大称重 $K_{new} = 4 + 9 = 13$（覆盖 $1$ 到 $13$）。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>第四个砝码</strong>：当前 $K=13$，则 $w_4 = 2(13) + 1 = 27$。<ul>\n<li>当前最大称重 $K_{new} = 13 + 27 = 40$。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>结论</strong>：最优的砝码组合是 $3$ 的幂次方（$1, 3, 9, 27, \\dots$）。<br>题目转化为：找到最小的整数 $n$，使得前 $n$ 个 $3$ 的幂次方之和大于等于 $N$。</p>\n<p>递推公式为：</p>\n<script type=\"math/tex; mode=display\">S_n = S_{n-1} \\times 3 + 1</script><p>当 $S_n \\ge N$ 时，$n$ 即为答案。</p>\n<h2 id=\"代码实现\"><a href=\"#代码实现\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"代码实现\"></a>代码实现</h2><h3 id=\"Python-代码\"><a href=\"#Python-代码\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"Python 代码\"></a>Python 代码</h3><figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br><span class=\"line\">23</span><br><span class=\"line\">24</span><br><span class=\"line\">25</span><br><span class=\"line\">26</span><br><span class=\"line\">27</span><br><span class=\"line\">28</span><br><span class=\"line\">29</span><br><span class=\"line\">30</span><br><span class=\"line\">31</span><br><span class=\"line\">32</span><br><span class=\"line\">33</span><br><span class=\"line\">34</span><br><span class=\"line\">35</span><br><span class=\"line\">36</span><br><span class=\"line\">37</span><br><span class=\"line\">38</span><br><span class=\"line\">39</span><br><span class=\"line\">40</span><br><span class=\"line\">41</span><br><span class=\"line\">42</span><br><span class=\"line\">43</span><br><span class=\"line\">44</span><br><span class=\"line\">45</span><br><span class=\"line\">46</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">solve</span>():</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 初始化当前能称出的最大重量为 0</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    current_max = <span class=\"number\">0</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 初始化砝码数量为 0</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    count = <span class=\"number\">0</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    </span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">try</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        N = <span class=\"built_in\">int</span>(<span class=\"built_in\">input</span>())</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">except</span> EOFError:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">return</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 循环直到能称出的最大重量大于等于 N</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">while</span> current_max &lt; N:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        count += <span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"comment\"># 根据公式：新砝码 = 当前最大 * 2 + 1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"comment\"># 实际上，新的最大称重 = 当前最大 * 3 + 1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"comment\"># 推导：new_max = current_max + (2*current_max + 1) = 3*current_max + 1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        current_max = current_max * <span class=\"number\">3</span> + <span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        </span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(count)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">if</span> __name__ == <span class=\"string\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">    solve()</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">### 代码解析</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">1.</span>  **变量初始化**：`current_max` 代表当前砝码组合能连续称出的最大重量。初始为 <span class=\"number\">0</span>，代表还没有砝码。</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">2.</span>  **循环条件**：`<span class=\"keyword\">while</span> current_max &lt; N`，只要当前能称出的重量还达不到目标 $N$，就需要继续加砝码。</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">3.</span>  **状态转移**：每次循环，砝码数量 `count` 加 <span class=\"number\">1</span>。根据数学推导，加入新砝码后，能称出的最大重量变为原来的 <span class=\"number\">3</span> 倍加 <span class=\"number\">1</span>（即 `current_max = current_max * <span class=\"number\">3</span> + <span class=\"number\">1</span>`）。</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">4.</span>  **输出结果**：当循环结束时，`count` 即为最少需要的砝码数。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">## 复杂度分析</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">-   **时间复杂度**：$O(\\log_3 N)$。因为 `current_max` 每次以 <span class=\"number\">3</span> 倍增长，增长速度非常快，循环次数极少。</span><br><span class=\"line\">-   **空间复杂度**：$O(<span class=\"number\">1</span>)$。只使用了几个变量存储状态，不需要额外的数组空间。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">## 示例验证</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">假设输入 $N = <span class=\"number\">20</span>$：</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">1.</span>  初始 `current_max = <span class=\"number\">0</span>`, `count = <span class=\"number\">0</span>`。</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">2.</span>  第一轮：`count = <span class=\"number\">1</span>`, `current_max = <span class=\"number\">0</span>*<span class=\"number\">3</span>+<span class=\"number\">1</span> = <span class=\"number\">1</span>` (&lt; <span class=\"number\">20</span>)。</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">3.</span>  第二轮：`count = <span class=\"number\">2</span>`, `current_max = <span class=\"number\">1</span>*<span class=\"number\">3</span>+<span class=\"number\">1</span> = <span class=\"number\">4</span>` (&lt; <span class=\"number\">20</span>)。</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">4.</span>  第三轮：`count = <span class=\"number\">3</span>`, `current_max = <span class=\"number\">4</span>*<span class=\"number\">3</span>+<span class=\"number\">1</span> = <span class=\"number\">13</span>` (&lt; <span class=\"number\">20</span>)。</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">5.</span>  第四轮：`count = <span class=\"number\">4</span>`, `current_max = <span class=\"number\">13</span>*<span class=\"number\">3</span>+<span class=\"number\">1</span> = <span class=\"number\">40</span>` (&gt;= <span class=\"number\">20</span>)。</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">6.</span>  结束循环，输出 `<span class=\"number\">4</span>`。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">砝码组合为：$<span class=\"number\">1</span>, <span class=\"number\">3</span>, <span class=\"number\">9</span>, <span class=\"number\">27</span>$。可以验证，这 <span class=\"number\">4</span> 个砝码能称出 $<span class=\"number\">1</span>$ 到 $<span class=\"number\">40</span>$ 的所有整数重量。</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>","categories":[{"name":"Algorithm","path":"api/categories/Algorithm.json"}],"tags":[{"name":"LanQiao","path":"api/tags/LanQiao.json"},{"name":"Algorithm","path":"api/tags/Algorithm.json"},{"name":"Greedy","path":"api/tags/Greedy.json"},{"name":"Math","path":"api/tags/Math.json"}]}